<section class="section white-100">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="section-badge">
                <div>FAQ</div>
              </div>
              <h2 class="section-heading center">Questions, answered</h2>
              <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                <p class="font-regular center">Everything you need to know before booking your plumbing service.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-wrap">
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Do you offer emergency plumbing services?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap v1">
                  <p class="faq-ans">Yes — we run a 24/7 emergency rota, so there is always an engineer on call. Burst pipe at two in the morning or no hot water in a rental, ring the emergency line and a person will answer.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">How quickly can a plumber arrive?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M12 5V19"></path>
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap v1">
                  <p class="faq-ans">For emergencies we aim to have a technician with you within 60 to 90 minutes. Standard bookings are usually scheduled for the same day or the next working day, depending on your preferred time slot.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card">
                <div class="faq-top">
                  <div class="faq-title">Do you provide upfront estimates?</div>
                  <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon _02">
