                    </svg><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon">
                      <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" d="M5 12H19"></path>
                    </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-ans-wrap v1">
                  <p class="faq-ans">You can. Fill in the request form on this page with your preferred date and time and we will confirm the appointment by phone or email.</p>
